@startuml
title SYS-SEQ02  UC02 浏览和搜索校园商品及用户
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #111111
    LifeLineBorderColor #777777
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #7A8796
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #222222
    ActorBorderColor #7A8796
    ActorBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ActorFontColor #222222
    GroupBorderColor #F0A060
    GroupHeaderFontColor #333333
    GroupFontColor #333333
    ActivationBorderColor #5E6A78
    ActivationBackgroundColor #DCE8F8
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerBorderColor #999999
}

actor 游客 as Guest
actor 学生用户 as Student
participant 校园二手交易平台 as System

group 游客浏览和搜索商品
    Guest -> System : 输入关键词/筛选条件/排序方式
    activate System
    System -> System : 按商品可见性规则检索
    System --> Guest : 返回可见商品列表
    Guest -> System : 查看某商品详情
    System -> System : 校验商品当前可见状态
    alt 商品允许公开查看
        System --> Guest : 返回商品详情
    else 商品不可见
        System --> Guest : 返回不可查看提示
    end
    deactivate System
end

group 学生搜索商品或用户
    Student -> System : 搜索商品或用户
    activate System
    System -> System : 应用关键词、筛选和排序条件
    System -> System : 校验可见性与隐私规则
    alt 搜索商品
        System --> Student : 返回符合条件的商品结果
    else 搜索用户
        System --> Student : 返回允许展示的用户信息
    end
    deactivate System
end

group 查看搜索结果详情
    Student -> System : 打开商品详情
    activate System
    System -> System : 根据当前身份再次校验可见范围
    System --> Student : 返回允许查看的商品与卖家公开信息
    deactivate System
end
@enduml
